  "bio": "Artists\nSuppliers\nAbout\nImmerse yourself in the bold artistry of Goliath Tattoo Studio, a standout creative haven nestled in the heart of Phoenix. Here, a team of gifted artists, including Jason Frieling, Taylor Made, Priscilla, Wang Tattoo Art, Strait Ink, Piercings by Wombo, and Art by Kendra Collier, masterfully craft striking black & gray and trash polka designs that encapsulate individuality and edge. Step into a vibrant environment where passion for ink meets the pinnacle of personal expression.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Phoenix, Arizona, United States"
